{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013MkbTNM5n4m5vVZ2w7YmBT","type":"tool_result","content":"/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5644/docs/specs/dependency-map.yaml:      Both ls and du produce human-readable output that requires formatting logic beyond\n/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5644/docs/specs/dependency-map.yaml:      file types, and both ls and du convert byte counts to human-readable sizes\n/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5644/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd008-ls.yaml:  and GNU ls in column layout, color handling, long-format field widths, and human-readable\n/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5644/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd008-ls.yaml:  colorization, and human-readable size conversion.\n/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5644/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd008-ls.yaml:  - G4: Support colorized output, human-readable sizes, file type classification, metadata display, and recursive listing.\n/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5644/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd008-ls.yaml:          text: -h must also apply to the \"total N\" block count line in long format. When -h is active, convert the total block count (sum(fi.Blocks)/2 as int64) to a human-readable string using the same binary algorithm before printing \"total X\\n\".\n/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5644/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd008-ls.yaml:            block counts to human-readable form. Use pkg/format.HumanSize(bytes int64,\n/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5644/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd106-df.yaml:  - G2: Support human-readable output (-h for binary, -H for SI units).\n/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5644/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd106-df.yaml:            -h or --human-readable must display sizes using binary units (1024-based: K, M, G,\n/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5644/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd041-id.yaml:  - cmd/id does not support the -p (human-readable) BSD extension not present in GNU id.\n/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5644/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd071-numfmt.yaml:  and human-readable formats with SI or IEC suffixes (e.g., 1K, 1Ki, 1M). macOS has no\n/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5644/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd071-numfmt.yaml:  - G1: Convert numbers between raw numeric and human-readable formats.\n/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5644/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd071-numfmt.yaml:          text: \"When given --to=UNIT, must convert each input number to a human-readable string with the appropriate suffix. UNIT is one of: si (powers of 1000), iec (powers of 1024), iec-i (powers of 1024 with 'i' suffix), or none.\"\n/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5644/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd071-numfmt.yaml:          text: \"When given --from=UNIT, must interpret each input number as a human-readable string with suffixes and convert to a raw number. UNIT values are the same as --to.\"\n/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5644/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd105-stty.yaml:          text: \"-a or --all must print all current terminal settings in a human-readable format.\"\n/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5644/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd105-stty.yaml:          text: \"-g or --save must print all current terminal settings in a machine-readable format (stty-readable) that can be passed back as arguments to restore settings.\"\n/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5644/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd105-stty.yaml:    criterion: \"stty -g prints machine-readable settings, matching gstty -g.\"\n/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5644/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd009-du.yaml:  st_dev and st_ino for hard-link deduplication) and pkg/format for human-readable size\n/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5644/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd009-du.yaml:  - G3: Support human-readable output (-h) matching GNU du -h formatting.\n/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5644/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd009-du.yaml:            -h must display sizes as human-readable strings using binary mode (1024-based) via pkg/format.HumanSize(bytes int64, opts HumanSizeOpts) string with opts.Binary = true (1024-base units, suffixes K/M/G/T/P/E). -h applies to all output lines including the grand total line when -c is also given.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_019mhqP73ZquCVo2Eb2hfoPb","session_id":"134b6010-6885-4f08-8e6f-190349c7e60e","uuid":"413059a7-1c72-4c2d-bb83-e3b2198fc9b0","timestamp":"2026-05-29T15:30:32.319Z"}
