{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01YAKk98vP71YUrH9GcoiVEP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Implementation complete. Here's a summary of what was done:\n\n**Files created/modified:**\n\n- **`cmd/stty/flags.go`** (92 lines) — Extracted type definitions (`flagDef`, `ccDef`) and flag arrays from main.go. Fixed cflag ordering to match GNU stty -a output (parenb, parodd, cstopb, hupcl, cread, clocal). Renamed \"reprint\" to \"rprnt\" and moved \"status\" after \"time\" in controlChars to match gstty.\n\n- **`cmd/stty/display.go`** (232 lines) — Contains all display logic:\n  - `printAllDisplay` (R2.1): Prints all settings with GNU-compatible wrapping at terminal width, organized as speed line → control chars → cflag/iflag/oflag/lflag lines\n  - `printSaveFormat` (R3.1): Outputs `iflag:oflag:cflag:lflag:cc[0]:...:cc[19]:ispeed:ospeed` in hex\n  - Existing `printDefaultDisplay` (R1.1) moved here with helpers\n\n- **`cmd/stty/settings.go`** (128 lines) — R4.1 implementation:\n  - `applySettings`: Iterates setting names, toggles termios bits, calls `IoctlSetTermios`\n  - Handles flag enable/disable (`echo`/`-echo`), CSIZE settings (`cs5`-`cs8`), and `-g` format restore (colon-separated hex)\n\n- **`cmd/stty/main.go`** (124 lines) — Rewritten with:\n  - `parseArgs` supporting `-a`/`--all`, `-g`/`--save`, `-F DEVICE`/`--file=DEVICE`/`--file DEVICE`, and setting name arguments\n  - `openFD` (R3.2): Opens specified device with `O_RDONLY|O_NONBLOCK`\n  - Error messages capitalize system errors to match GNU format\n\n- **`cmd/stty/stty_test.go`** (34 lines) — 11 differential test cases covering all four requirements against `gstty`.\n\n**Verification:** `go build` clean, `go vet` clean, `go test` passes."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":348,"cache_read_input_tokens":103842,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephem